Hospital, ex-Ospedali Riuniti, Bergamo, Italy.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Cumetti</LastName><ForeName>Davide</ForeName><Initials>D</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Internal Medicine Department, Papa Giovanni XXIII Hospital, ex-Ospedali Riuniti, Bergamo, Italy.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Varbella</LastName><ForeName>Ferdinando</ForeName><Initials>F</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Cardiology Department, Ospedale degli Infermi, Rivoli, Italy.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Trinchero</LastName><ForeName>Rita</ForeName><Initials>R</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Cardiology Department, Maria Vittoria Hospital, Turin, Italy.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Spodick</LastName><ForeName>David H</ForeName><Initials>DH</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Internal Medicine Department, St Vincent Hospital, Worcester, MA, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Adler</LastName><ForeName>Yehuda</ForeName><Initials>Y</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Chaim Sheba Medical Center, Tel Hashomer and Sacker Faculty of Medicine, Tel Aviv, Israel.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author></AuthorList><Language>eng</Language><DataBankList CompleteYN="Y"><DataBank><DataBankName>ClinicalTrials.gov</DataBankName><AccessionNumberList><AccessionNumber>NCT00235079</AccessionNumber></AccessionNumberList></DataBank></DataBankList><PublicationTypeList><PublicationType UI="D016428">Journal Article</PublicationType><PublicationType UI="D016448">Multicenter Study</PublicationType><PublicationType UI="D016449">Randomized Controlled Trial</PublicationType><PublicationType UI="D013485">Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't</PublicationType></PublicationTypeList><ArticleDate DateType="Electronic"><Year>2014</Year><Month>03</Month><Day>30</Day></ArticleDate></Article><MedlineJournalInfo>